# Read which calibration artefacts already exist on disk so the
# Roboter Studio wizard can hydrate per-step badges after a page reload.
# No request fields — this is a simple status read.
#
# Reads the persisted YAMLs (scene_intrinsics.yaml, scene_handeye.yaml) via
# the CalibrationManager has_* helpers. Cheap; safe to call on every wizard
# mount. The has_gripper_* / has_color_profile response fields are vestigial
# (gripper camera + colour detection were removed) and always reported True.
---
bool success
string message
bool has_gripper_intrinsics
bool has_scene_intrinsics
bool has_gripper_handeye
bool has_scene_handeye
bool has_color_profile
# Touch-off table measurement solved (scene extrinsic YAML carries a measured
# table_plane). Optional accuracy step — recommended, not gating.
bool has_table_plane
